		{
			description: [
				"&bAd Astra&r is an exciting &6space exploration mod&r that opens up a universe of possibilities for Minecraft players. Dive into the wonders of space travel, build &dadvanced spacecraft&r, and discover &enew planets&r filled with unique resources and challenges."
				""
				"&9主要特性&r："
				"- &a建造并定制你自己的宇宙飞船&r，前往遥远的世界。"
				"- &e探索新星球&r，每个星球都有独特的环境、资源和秘密。"
				"- &5Mine rare ores and gather exotic materials&r found only on alien planets."
				"- 在其他星球上&c建立基地&r，并开展&f星际贸易&r。"
				"- &d研究先进技术&r，以改进你的航天器和装备。"
				""
				"有了 &bAd Astra&r，天空不再是极限。踏上超越星辰的旅程，在 Minecraft 中体验太空探索的惊险刺激。准备好探索、发现并征服新的疆域吧！"
